Package: AndesBIIGLE
Title: Create BIIGLE Volume From ANDES Mission
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Author: Les amis de l'IML
Maintainer: David Sean-Fortin <david.sean-fortin@dfo-mpo.gc.ca>
Description: Connects to an ANDES mission and create a BIIGLE volume from caputred images. This will create a labeltree and add tags (species code, aphiaid, set number) taken from ANDES.
